# Lumenhold Academy — 简体中文 (zh-CN) translation of content/events/expansion_summer.grim
# Maintained by `node tools/grim.js i18n zh-CN`. Translate the text after "="; keep {tokens}.
# "# en:" shows the English source. [hash] marks the English version a line was translated from;
# lines marked STALE need updating — after fixing the text, delete the [hash] and re-run the tool.


@event sum_empty_castle
# en: The Empty Castle
title [38b303] = 空荡荡的城堡
# en: In summer the castle breathes differently. Corridors you've walked a thousand times are silent; doors that are always locked stand slightly open. A portrait yawns. Nobody is watching.
text [b8e5ca] = 夏天，城堡的呼吸都不一样了。你走过上千次的走廊寂静无声；那些永远上锁的门微微敞开着。一幅画像打了个哈欠。没有人在看。
# en: A vast empty dining hall in summer, chairs upturned on the tables, a single student eating alone in a shaft of dusty sunlight.
scene [06e080] = 夏日里一间空旷的大餐厅，椅子倒扣在桌上，一名学生独自坐在满是浮尘的阳光里吃饭。
# en: Explore the open doors
opt.left.label [476a88] = 探索那些敞开的门
# en: Behind one door: a forgotten trophy room. Behind another: a professor's stash of very old toffee and a purse of lost-property coins nobody will miss.
opt.left.say.1 [a2c1c1] = 一扇门后：一间被遗忘的奖杯室。另一扇门后：某位教授私藏的陈年太妃糖，还有一袋没人会惦记的失物招领硬币。
# en: Behind the first door: the caretaker, in a dressing gown, very surprised. You both agree this never happened.
opt.left.say.2 [eeeeef] = 第一扇门后：穿着睡袍、大吃一惊的管理员。你们俩一致同意，这事从没发生过。
# en: Enjoy the quiet
opt.right.label [293287] = 享受这份安静
# en: You read in window seats, nap on the great lawn and eat breakfast at noon. For two weeks the most famous academy in the kingdom is just a big, peaceful house.
opt.right.say.1 [08d11a] = 你在窗台上看书，在大草坪上打盹，中午才吃早饭。整整两个星期，王国最有名的学院只是一座又大又安宁的房子。

@event sum_home_chores
# en: Help Around the House
title [da7efc] = 帮家里干活
# en: Home is lovely for about three days. Then the list appears on the kitchen door: the roof, the goats, the fence, the cousin's wedding. Your summer reading list is hidden under a tea towel.
text [e1f4e8] = 家的美好大概能维持三天。然后清单就贴上了厨房门：屋顶、山羊、篱笆、表亲的婚礼。你的暑期书单被藏在一块茶巾底下。
# en: A farmhouse kitchen in high summer, a basket of laundry, a list of chores pinned to the door, a textbook hidden under a tea towel.
scene [c81350] = 盛夏的农舍厨房，一篮待洗的衣物，门上钉着家务清单，一本课本藏在茶巾底下。
# en: Do the chores — with magic
opt.left.label [2b5166] = 干家务——用魔法
# en: The fence mends itself, the goats are briefly levitated, the roof is better than new. The whole street comes to watch. Your mother pretends not to be proud.
opt.left.say.1 [6cae25] = 篱笆自己补好了，山羊短暂地浮了起来，屋顶比新的还好。整条街的人都跑来看。你妈妈假装一点也不骄傲。
# en: The goats are briefly levitated. Unfortunately so is the fence. Your family is very patient about it.
opt.left.say.2 [4bdcaf] = 山羊短暂地浮了起来。不幸的是，篱笆也浮起来了。你的家人对此非常有耐心。
# en: Do them the slow way, and talk
opt.right.label [b2c300] = 慢慢干，顺便聊聊
# en: You fix the fence by hand with your father, saying very little and then, suddenly, a lot. It's the best conversation you've had all year.
opt.right.say.1 [775d96] = 你和爸爸一起亲手修篱笆，一开始几乎不说话，后来突然说了很多。这是你一整年里最好的一次谈话。

@event sum_old_friend
# en: An Old Friend
title [8809c5] = 老朋友
# en: Your oldest friend from home is waiting at the crossroads, like always. But something's different. "So," they say, not quite looking at you, "I suppose you're too grand for us now."
text [66198b] = 你在家乡最老的朋友照例等在十字路口。但有些东西不一样了。“所以，”对方说，眼睛没怎么看你，“我猜你现在看不上我们了吧。”
# en: Two young people sitting on a stone wall above a village, one in academy robes, one in work clothes, a little space between them.
scene [b48b9c] = 两个年轻人坐在村子上方的石墙上，一个穿着学院长袍，一个穿着干活的衣服，中间隔着一点距离。
# en: Prove you're not
opt.left.label [4cb06b] = 证明你没有
# en: You spend the summer exactly as you used to — orchard raids, river swims, terrible jokes. By Starfall, the space between you on the wall is gone.
opt.left.say.1 [8019a4] = 你像从前一样度过这个夏天——偷果园、下河游泳、讲烂笑话。到了星坠月，石墙上你们之间的那点距离不见了。
# en: Admit you've changed
opt.right.label [11cd37] = 承认你变了
# en: "I have," you say. "So have you." They laugh, surprised. You talk all night about who you're both becoming. It's different from before. It might be better.
opt.right.say.1 [84ee4c] = “我是变了，”你说，“你也变了。”对方惊讶地笑了。你们聊了一整夜，聊你们各自正在变成什么样的人。和从前不一样了。也许会更好。

@event sum_midsummer_fair
# en: The Midsummer Fair
title [fa85d7] = 仲夏集市
# en: The village Midsummer Fair: enchanted carousel, ring-toss, a strongman, and a booth promising "GUESS YOUR WEIGHT IN CHEESE". You have a few crowns in your pocket and a whole afternoon.
text [d583e2] = 村里的仲夏集市：魔法旋转木马、套圈、大力士，还有一个摊位承诺“猜猜你的体重等于多少奶酪”。你兜里有几个克朗，还有一整个下午。
# en: A village green full of striped tents, a carousel of enchanted wooden animals, lanterns strung between trees, a strongman lifting a cow.
scene [b2cfbf] = 村子草地上满是条纹帐篷，一座由施了魔法的木头动物组成的旋转木马，树间挂着灯笼，一个大力士正举起一头牛。
# en: Win something at the ring-toss
opt.left.label [1e7b9b] = 套圈赢个奖
# en: Three rings, three hits. You win a stuffed griffon the size of a sheep and sell it to a crying child's father for fifteen crowns. Everyone wins.
opt.left.say.1 [b0aa3b] = 三个圈，三个全中。你赢了一只绵羊那么大的狮鹫玩偶，又以十五克朗卖给了一个哭闹孩子的爸爸。皆大欢喜。
# en: Every ring bounces off. The ring-toss is definitely enchanted. You don't care; you're eating candied apples.
opt.left.say.2 [09da43] = 每个圈都弹开了。这套圈摊绝对施了魔法。你不在乎，你正在吃糖苹果。
# en: Ride the carousel
opt.right.label [a83496] = 坐旋转木马
# en: Your wooden hippogriff takes off, very slightly, at the top of every turn. You ride it nine times.
opt.right.say.1 [8ddedf] = 你的木头鹰马每转到最高处都会轻轻地飞起来一点点。你坐了九次。

@event sum_letter_from_friend
# en: A Summer Letter
title [947c1f] = 夏日来信
# en: An owl arrives with a thick, slightly crumpled letter from {npc}. Six pages of summer news, two doodles, one pressed flower, and at the end, in smaller writing: "I miss the castle. I miss you, actually."
text [915df1] = 一只猫头鹰送来了{npc}一封厚厚的、有点皱的信。六页夏日见闻，两幅涂鸦，一朵压花，最后用小一号的字写着：“我想念城堡。其实，我想你。”
# en: A thick letter with a doodle on the envelope arriving by owl at a summer window.
scene [c7230f] = 一封信封上画着涂鸦的厚信，由猫头鹰送到夏日的窗前。
# en: Write a short reply
opt.left.label [2e26d1] = 写一封简短的回信
# en: You write a page. It's warm, if brief. {npc} keeps it anyway.
opt.left.say.1 [ae145d] = 你写了一页。温暖，虽然简短。{npc}还是把它收了起来。
# en: Write back for hours
opt.right.label [c44657] = 回信写上几个钟头
# en: You write until the candle gutters. Twelve pages. You can't remember the last time you wrote that much that wasn't an essay.
opt.right.say.1 [d776a8] = 你一直写到蜡烛快灭。十二页。你都不记得上次写这么多不是论文的东西是什么时候了。

@event sum_rain_week
# en: A Week of Rain
title [fa6851] = 一星期的雨
# en: It rains for a solid week. Not dramatic rain: just steady, grey, endless rain. Every plan you made for the summer is quietly drowning.
text [8b734b] = 雨整整下了一个星期。不是戏剧性的雨，只是稳定、灰暗、没完没了的雨。你为这个夏天做的每一个计划都在悄悄被淹没。
# en: Rain streaming down a tall window, a student curled in an armchair with a fat novel, a teapot steaming on the sill.
scene [ea0fc1] = 雨水顺着高窗流下，一名学生蜷在扶手椅里捧着一本厚小说，窗台上的茶壶冒着热气。
# en: Read a very long novel
opt.left.label [fc9cb2] = 读一本很长的小说
# en: You buy an eight-hundred-page novel about a family of sea-witches, read every word and cry at the end. It's the best week of the summer.
opt.left.say.1 [f8199f] = 你买了一本八百页的小说，讲一个海巫家族的故事，一字不落地读完，读到结尾哭了。这是整个夏天最好的一周。
# en: Practise spells indoors
opt.right.label [8f2ff7] = 在室内练咒语
# en: You practise until you can light every candle in the room with a flick. You also set fire to one curtain. It's raining; it goes out quickly.
opt.right.say.1 [f19727] = 你一直练到手指一弹就能点亮房间里每一支蜡烛。你还烧着了一块窗帘。外面在下雨，火很快就灭了。

@event sum_sea_serpent
# en: Fishing With an Uncle
title [340021] = 和叔叔去钓鱼
# en: Your uncle takes you fishing. Something takes the bait. Something very large. The line sings. The boat tilts. A long scaled neck rises out of the water and looks at you with polite interest.
text [fbf017] = 叔叔带你去钓鱼。有东西咬钩了。非常大的东西。鱼线嗡嗡作响，船身倾斜。一条长满鳞片的长脖子从水里升起，带着礼貌的好奇看着你。
# en: A small fishing boat on a grey-green sea, a fishing line drawn taut, something very long and scaled rising beside the hull.
scene [035dc5] = 灰绿色海面上的一条小渔船，鱼线绷得紧紧的，一个很长、长满鳞片的东西正从船边升起。
# en: Cut the line
opt.left.label [c4df32] = 剪断鱼线
# en: The serpent sinks back with a sigh like a disappointed whale. Your uncle tells the story for the rest of his life, and it gets bigger every time.
opt.left.say.1 [f3a3c3] = 海蛇叹了口气沉了回去，像一头失望的鲸鱼。你叔叔后半辈子都在讲这个故事，而且每讲一次就更大一点。
# en: Try to talk to it
opt.right.label [2c2211] = 试着和它说话
# en: You greet it in the old courtesies Professor Brask taught you. It bows its great head, leaves a pearl on the deck and swims away. Your uncle faints.
opt.right.say.1 [02a4d5] = 你用布拉斯克教授教过的古老礼节向它问好。它低下巨大的头，在甲板上留下一颗珍珠，然后游走了。你叔叔晕了过去。
# en: The serpent is not interested in conversation. It is interested in the boat. You swim home.
opt.right.say.2 [c01ca7] = 海蛇对谈话没兴趣。它对船有兴趣。你是游回家的。

@event sum_reading_list
# en: The Summer Reading List
title [2a9b43] = 暑期书单
# en: The summer reading list arrives by owl. It is a scroll. It unrolls across the floor, out of the door and partway down the stairs. Thorne has added a note at the bottom: "Optional. (It is not optional.)"
text [56544a] = 暑期书单由猫头鹰送达。是一卷羊皮纸。它在地板上展开，滚出门外，一直滚到楼梯中间。索恩在最下面加了一句：“选读。（并不是选读。）”
# en: A long scroll unrolling off a table and across the floor, a list of titles in tiny handwriting, a student staring at it in despair.
scene [593aae] = 一卷长长的羊皮纸从桌上滚落、铺满地板，上面用极小的字写满书名，一名学生绝望地盯着它。
# en: Read all of it
opt.left.label [281ec8] = 全部读完
# en: You read everything. When term starts, Thorne asks a question about the last book and you're the only one who can answer. His eyebrow rises half a millimetre.
opt.left.say.1 [0c1e02] = 你全读完了。开学时，索恩问了一个关于最后一本书的问题，只有你答得上来。他的眉毛抬高了半毫米。
# en: Read the first and last chapters of each
opt.right.label [2423ad] = 每本只读第一章和最后一章
# en: A time-honoured strategy. You can talk confidently about the beginning and end of forty books. The middle remains a mystery, like most of life.
opt.right.say.1 [bca605] = 一个历史悠久的策略。你能自信地谈论四十本书的开头和结尾。中间部分仍然是个谜，就像人生的大部分一样。

@event sum_night_market
# en: The Night Market
title [8fbd8e] = 夜市
# en: A night market appears in a field outside the village — it wasn't there yesterday and won't be tomorrow. A hooded stall-keeper offers you a stoppered bottle with a tiny thundercloud inside. "Fifteen crowns. What it does is a surprise."
text [8af6b0] = 村外的田野里出现了一个夜市——昨天还没有，明天也不会在。一个戴兜帽的摊主递给你一个塞着瓶塞的瓶子，里面有一小朵雷雨云。“十五克朗。它有什么用？那是个惊喜。”
# en: A market that only appears after midnight, stalls lit with coloured flames, hooded sellers, a bottle that seems to contain a small thundercloud.
scene [ad8492] = 一个只在午夜后出现的集市，摊位亮着彩色火焰，戴兜帽的卖家，一个瓶子里似乎装着一小朵雷雨云。
# en: Buy the bottle
opt.left.label [19c560] = 买下瓶子
# en: You uncork it in your room. The little storm rains ideas on you for a fortnight. Your notebooks overflow.
opt.left.say.1 [3066ff] = 你在房间里拔开瓶塞。那场小风暴往你身上下了两星期的灵感雨。你的笔记本都写满了。
# en: You uncork it in your room. The little storm rains on you. Just rain. For a fortnight. You catch a cold.
opt.left.say.2 [07314d] = 你在房间里拔开瓶塞。那场小风暴往你身上下雨。就是雨。下了两星期。你感冒了。
# en: Just look around
opt.right.label [1c076f] = 只是逛逛
# en: You wander until dawn, buying nothing, watching everything. When the sun rises the field is empty except for a single glowing feather. You keep it.
opt.right.say.1 [a046d1] = 你一直逛到黎明，什么也没买，什么都看了。太阳升起时，田野里空空荡荡，只剩一根发光的羽毛。你把它留了下来。

@event sum_end_of_summer
# en: The Last Week of Summer
title [64767a] = 夏天的最后一周
# en: The last week of summer has that particular light — golden, heavy, already nostalgic. Your trunk is half-packed. Part of you is desperate to get back. Part of you wants this week to last forever.
text [fa47ef] = 夏天的最后一周有一种特别的光——金黄、沉甸甸的，已经带着怀念。你的箱子收拾了一半。一部分的你迫不及待想回去，一部分的你希望这一周永远不要结束。
# en: A student packing a trunk in golden late-summer light, a half-finished jar of jam, a pressed flower and a new textbook on the bed.
scene [79a65d] = 一名学生在夏末的金色光线里收拾箱子，床上放着半罐果酱、一朵压花和一本新课本。
# en: Squeeze every drop out of it
opt.left.label [660c83] = 榨干它的每一滴
# en: Late swims, long dinners, one final sunset from the hill. You arrive at the barge sunburnt and happy and only slightly late.
opt.left.say.1 [3d2155] = 很晚的游泳、很长的晚餐、山顶上最后一次日落。你到达驳船时晒伤了、很开心，只迟到了一点点。
# en: Get ready for the new year
opt.right.label [50fe4f] = 为新学年做准备
# en: You re-read your notes, sharpen your quills and polish your wand. When term starts you are, for once, ahead. It's an unfamiliar feeling.
opt.right.say.1 [fbc642] = 你重读笔记，削好羽毛笔，擦亮魔杖。开学时你难得地领先了一步。这是一种陌生的感觉。
